From: Stuart0808 <20211402@bjtu.edu.cn>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 09:53:14 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] Docs and the debugger index know loops as regions only

The loop notes (loops, debugger, facts, GIR interchange) describe the regions and the plan's
events instead of the loop graphs, the capture table and the lowering; the debugger index no
longer looks for loop graphs.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HPQpHqPqSJbP9yRrJbDvye
